<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Travel Booking Status Update</title>
    {{> styles }}
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <img src="https://i.imgur.com/SkOGGbd.png" alt="Company Logo">
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h1>Travel Booking Status Update</h1>
            <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
            <p>Jai Sadguru Dev Vandan! The status on your travel booking request has changed from Mumbai To Research Center to <strong>{{status}}</strong>:</p>
            <div class="details">
                <p><strong>Booking id: </strong>{{bookingid}}</p>
                <p><strong>Travel Date: </strong>{{date}}</p>
                <p><strong>Pick-up location: </strong>{{pickup}}</p>
                <p><strong>Drop-off location: </strong>{{drop}}</p>
            </div>
            <p>You can view the status of your Raj Pravas Request on our Vitaag Vigyan Aashray app. </p>
            <p>  1.  Select Booking tab  </p>
            <p>  2.  Select to Raj Pavas </p>
            <p>If your travel booking status is <strong>proceed for payment</strong>, 
            <p> Please click on Pay Now button next to your Booking in the app.</p>
            
            <p>Once your travel is confirmed, you can coordinate with Sandeep Driver on <strong>+919769975704</strong> only on the date of your travel.</p>
            <p>Regards,</p>
            <p>Raj Pravas Admin,</p>
            <p>Virag Shah (9769644960)<br>Siddhi Shah (9831632801)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2025 SRATRC. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
